      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For your premium skincare line, consider a persona named \"Sophia,\" a 35-year-old high-level executive in finance who values anonymity, avails expensive travel, and likely identifies as having a Western European cultural background. Her lifestyle revolves around minimalism in beauty products and seeking exclusivity, which your ads should highlight through elegant visuals and trusted luxury endorsements.\n\nRegarding your budget cleaners, create a persona called \"Marcus,\" a 42-year-old warehouse management professional who lived through a recession, often works night shifts, and has a practical family-oriented background rooted in South Asian cultures. His daily habits focus on rapid household turnover after long hours, so your campaigns should emphasize durability, value for money, and hard-working reliability rather than aesthetic luxury.",
